{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Marvel Contest of Champions",
    "steam_appid": 3127280,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/2049c6f5389b8e7d6f33bbc1fc8b1bc6.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/2049c6f5389b8e7d6f33bbc1fc8b1bc6.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/2049c6f5389b8e7d6f33bbc1fc8b1bc6.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MARVEL CONTEST OF CHAMPIONS IS NOW ON STEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate Marvel contest has arrived on PC! Step into The Battlerealm and experience epic 1v1 combat featuring your favorite Super Heroes and Villains from across the Marvel Universe \u2014 now fully optimized for mouse, keyboard, and controller on the big screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/4db74021897f05b97f878337019e30f0.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/4db74021897f05b97f878337019e30f0.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/4db74021897f05b97f878337019e30f0.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR MARVEL DREAM TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Summoner chosen by The Collector, assemble a powerful team from a roster of over 300 Champions \u2014 including iconic Avengers, X-Men, Guardians of the Galaxy, Spider-Verse heroes, and more! Whether you're teaming up Iron Man and Wolverine or pitting Deadpool against Venom, the combinations are endless and the stakes are high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/d36be49b362362d5b4400924bb96508c.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/d36be49b362362d5b4400924bb96508c.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/d36be49b362362d5b4400924bb96508c.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT YOUR WAY TO VICTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced battles against enemies and players from around the world. Master intuitive combat mechanics and unleash special attacks as you battle through cinematic storylines, competitive arenas, and time-limited events. Every fight brings you closer to becoming the Champion of The Battlerealm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/26c2192bde8b72b23b16cd09de62ff8e.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/26c2192bde8b72b23b16cd09de62ff8e.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/26c2192bde8b72b23b16cd09de62ff8e.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EPIC QUESTS, ICONIC STORIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an evolving narrative with thrilling Marvel-style storytelling. Explore new chapters, face powerful bosses, and uncover multiversal mysteries as you quest through The Battlerealm. Every update brings fresh content and new Champions to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/e9f9c9f1ae3bdb6e2c97dff543d25c38.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/e9f9c9f1ae3bdb6e2c97dff543d25c38.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/e9f9c9f1ae3bdb6e2c97dff543d25c38.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM UP AND RISE TO THE TOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with other Summoners in powerful Alliances. Coordinate strategies, take on global events, and dominate Alliance Wars and Alliance Quests to earn valuable rewards and climb the competitive ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/cc12a1e93174480bd81b21da05518117.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/cc12a1e93174480bd81b21da05518117.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/cc12a1e93174480bd81b21da05518117.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY, ANYWHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marvel Contest of Champions has been rebuilt for Steam, offering native support for controllers, keyboard, and mouse with customizable bindings. Enjoy full cross-platform support \u2014 start your journey on mobile and continue seamlessly on PC. Wherever you play, your progress goes with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CONTEST AWAITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the Marvel Universe rests in your hands. Will you rise to the challenge and lead your Champions to victory?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/2049c6f5389b8e7d6f33bbc1fc8b1bc6.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/2049c6f5389b8e7d6f33bbc1fc8b1bc6.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/2049c6f5389b8e7d6f33bbc1fc8b1bc6.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MARVEL CONTEST OF CHAMPIONS IS NOW ON STEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate Marvel contest has arrived on PC! Step into The Battlerealm and experience epic 1v1 combat featuring your favorite Super Heroes and Villains from across the Marvel Universe \u2014 now fully optimized for mouse, keyboard, and controller on the big screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/4db74021897f05b97f878337019e30f0.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/4db74021897f05b97f878337019e30f0.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/4db74021897f05b97f878337019e30f0.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR MARVEL DREAM TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Summoner chosen by The Collector, assemble a powerful team from a roster of over 300 Champions \u2014 including iconic Avengers, X-Men, Guardians of the Galaxy, Spider-Verse heroes, and more! Whether you're teaming up Iron Man and Wolverine or pitting Deadpool against Venom, the combinations are endless and the stakes are high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/d36be49b362362d5b4400924bb96508c.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/d36be49b362362d5b4400924bb96508c.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/d36be49b362362d5b4400924bb96508c.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT YOUR WAY TO VICTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced battles against enemies and players from around the world. Master intuitive combat mechanics and unleash special attacks as you battle through cinematic storylines, competitive arenas, and time-limited events. Every fight brings you closer to becoming the Champion of The Battlerealm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/26c2192bde8b72b23b16cd09de62ff8e.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/26c2192bde8b72b23b16cd09de62ff8e.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/26c2192bde8b72b23b16cd09de62ff8e.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EPIC QUESTS, ICONIC STORIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an evolving narrative with thrilling Marvel-style storytelling. Explore new chapters, face powerful bosses, and uncover multiversal mysteries as you quest through The Battlerealm. Every update brings fresh content and new Champions to collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/e9f9c9f1ae3bdb6e2c97dff543d25c38.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/e9f9c9f1ae3bdb6e2c97dff543d25c38.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/e9f9c9f1ae3bdb6e2c97dff543d25c38.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM UP AND RISE TO THE TOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with other Summoners in powerful Alliances. Coordinate strategies, take on global events, and dominate Alliance Wars and Alliance Quests to earn valuable rewards and climb the competitive ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/cc12a1e93174480bd81b21da05518117.poster.avif?t=1750356193\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/cc12a1e93174480bd81b21da05518117.webm?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127280/extras/cc12a1e93174480bd81b21da05518117.mp4?t=1750356193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY, ANYWHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marvel Contest of Champions has been rebuilt for Steam, offering native support for controllers, keyboard, and mouse with customizable bindings. Enjoy full cross-platform support \u2014 start your journey on mobile and continue seamlessly on PC. Wherever you play, your progress goes with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CONTEST AWAITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the Marvel Universe rests in your hands. Will you rise to the challenge and lead your Champions to victory?</p>",
